# inc-w6t0: (creature target) one wait turn first, so the goblin the probe
# placed is perceived and the aiming key can select it. Otherwise as
# stone-to-flesh-statue.keys:
# inc-w6t0: the player learns Stone to Flesh (wizard Learn Any Spell, an innate
# ability: always succeeds, costs no mana), then casts it at the statue the
# probe put one square east (INCURSION_STONE_FLESH_PROBE=statue). RIGHT is the
# aiming key that selects the nearest candidate to the east; ENTER confirms.
w
y
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Stone to Flesh" ENTER
@dump:learned
.
@while "more --" SPACE
m
@choose "Stone to Flesh"
@dump:aiming
RIGHT
@dump:aimed
ENTER
@dump:cast
.
@dump:after
@quit
